note bottom of JournalPost
  Requires an eligible reviewed journal and a
  poster different from its creator. Posting grant
  is provisional outside local/testing environments.
end note
note bottom of Periods
  Read-only context in web UI. There is no route
  to create accounting years or periods.
end note
